  "body": "Positioned in one of Milford's most sought-after neighbourhoods, this substantial family residence offers an exceptional combination of space, convenience and long-term appeal.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 614m² freehold section, this impressive home offers approximately 320m² of floor area, providing plenty of room for growing families, multi-generational living or those who simply appreciate having extra space.\r\n\r\nWith four well-proportioned bedrooms and generous living spaces, the home offers flexibility for modern family living. The outdoor deck provides an inviting setting for relaxing, entertaining guests or enjoying quality time with family.\r\n\r\nLocation is where this property truly stands out. Just a short stroll from Milford Shopping Centre, supermarkets, cafés and everyday amenities, everything you need is right at your doorstep. Excellent public transport connections also make commuting to the city and surrounding areas easy and convenient.\r\n\r\nFamilies will particularly appreciate the excellent school zoning, including Milford School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys' High School, Westlake Girls' High School and Takapuna Grammar School.\r\n\r\nWith its substantial floor area, freehold land, convenient location and outstanding educational options, this is an opportunity to secure a quality family home in the heart of Milford.\r\n\r\nSpace to grow, convenience to enjoy, and a location to love. Our vendor is ready to downsize and will considering a property trade within Milford area.\r\n\r\n\r\nEnquire today to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nTo view property files, please follow this link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/U8L2",
